    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/5962a8445fed9e0bc66a5a986e31ff12.avif?t=1748183258\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your survivor and equip them to\u00a0stay alive long enough to blow everything else to hell. Each one brings a different approach to the apocalypse - from rapid-fire specialists to heavy hitters. Whether you like precision or pure chaos, there\u2019s a weapon  waiting for you.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/e73abd3712533b5dd86afea6e9df532a.poster.avif?t=1748183258\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/e73abd3712533b5dd86afea6e9df532a.webm?t=1748183258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/e73abd3712533b5dd86afea6e9df532a.mp4?t=1748183258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/d3213b89951be1b042fa57e722b4fb42.avif?t=1748183258\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bullets do more than pierce - they bounce, explode, burn, zap, and corrode. Upgrade your firepower with elemental mods that light enemies ablaze, electrocute clusters, or melt through armored freaks.\u00a0Because regular ammo just doesn\u2019t cut it anymore.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/3749f01e74b1d35252fc4ab91e688472.poster.avif?t=1748183258\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/3749f01e74b1d35252fc4ab91e688472.webm?t=1748183258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/3749f01e74b1d35252fc4ab91e688472.mp4?t=1748183258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/522829e47e907c1dd5838e5922a89a1e.avif?t=1748183258\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make every second count with a deadly arsenal of deployables. Lob grenades to thin out hordes, drop turrets for suppressive fire, or bait enemies into explosive traps.<br>The battlefield is yours to control - creatively. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/d65510b587b540eaeda933b86d1a8277.poster.avif?t=1748183258\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/d65510b587b540eaeda933b86d1a8277.webm?t=1748183258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/d65510b587b540eaeda933b86d1a8277.mp4?t=1748183258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/8ca6295ffe3ac998514480e84ea4881b.avif?t=1748183258\" width=616 height=80 /></span>From swarming biters to grotesque elite mutants, every enemy is a threat - and every boss is a spectacle. Adapt fast or get overrun in brutal, high-intensity encounters that keep the pressure on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/cf3ce65ddaaf0f8a01c9aa0ade1648a8.poster.avif?t=1748183258\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/cf3ce65ddaaf0f8a01c9aa0ade1648a8.webm?t=1748183258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/cf3ce65ddaaf0f8a01c9aa0ade1648a8.mp4?t=1748183258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/cc1491f8d852949c13fd7b3de11d32b1.avif?t=1748183258\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a huge pool of mutations mid-run. Will you evolve to leech health, ricochet bullets, or leave trails of acid in your wake?<br>Every choice alters your strategy - and stacks the madness. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/cb46bb0d547fe7d85cf204c63f23070e.poster.avif?t=1748183258\" width=614 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/cb46bb0d547fe7d85cf204c63f23070e.webm?t=1748183258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/cb46bb0d547fe7d85cf204c63f23070e.mp4?t=1748183258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/720fc4ae4ddbea9605b1199aa8b0284e.avif?t=1748183258\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is where it all comes together. Mix elemental weapons, perks, and mutations to create ridiculous, overpowered builds.<br>Want bouncing flame bullets with life-steal while summoning decoys and zapping enemies? Yes, you can - and yes, it\u2019s glorious. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/078cd5903e4c91fcddb0ede081dc25d4.poster.avif?t=1748183258\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/078cd5903e4c91fcddb0ede081dc25d4.webm?t=1748183258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/078cd5903e4c91fcddb0ede081dc25d4.mp4?t=1748183258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/8fbdd7c82b8f1039f6e021948fd6eafe.avif?t=1748183258\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced, skill-driven combat</strong><br>Run, dodge, shoot, and survive in a relentless storm of chaos. Timing and aim matter - but smart build choices will tip the scales in your favor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique enemies and grotesque mutants</strong><br>From cowardly spitters to hulking abominations, every enemy brings a different threat. Expect swarming mobs, elite mini-bosses, and climactic end-level bosses that test your limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over-the-top weapons and elemental upgrades</strong><br>Fire, acid, lightning - your bullets don\u2019t just hurt, they humiliate. Bounce them off walls, ignite crowds, or corrode armored foes into sludge. Every upgrade changes how you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd mutations with game-changing effects</strong><br>Gain mutations during each run that radically alter your abilities. Leech health with every kill, spawn fire trails, or deploy grenade-launching turrets to fight by your side. Stack them to create madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple survivors and playstyles to master</strong><br>Whether you favor fast-moving sharpshooters, explosive brawlers, or balanced all-rounders, each survivor offers a unique playstyle with different strengths and weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical deployables that shape the battlefield</strong><br>Control the chaos with grenades, decoys, and turret placements. Set traps, hold choke points, or simply blow everything up in style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable roguelite runs with randomized upgrades</strong><br>Levels, enemy spawns, and upgrade choices are randomized every time you play - no two runs ever feel the same. Adapt on the fly and survive the unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless build variety and broken combos</strong><br>Want ricocheting flame bullets that leech life while your decoys explode into acid clouds? Go for it. The system is built to let you push the limits of what\u2019s possible - and what\u2019s absurd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/5962a8445fed9e0bc66a5a986e31ff12.avif?t=1748183258\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your survivor and equip them to\u00a0stay alive long enough to blow everything else to hell. Each one brings a different approach to the apocalypse - from rapid-fire specialists to heavy hitters. Whether you like precision or pure chaos, there\u2019s a weapon  waiting for you.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/e73abd3712533b5dd86afea6e9df532a.poster.avif?t=1748183258\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/e73abd3712533b5dd86afea6e9df532a.webm?t=1748183258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/e73abd3712533b5dd86afea6e9df532a.mp4?t=1748183258\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/d3213b89951be1b042fa57e722b4fb42.avif?t=1748183258\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your bullets do more than pierce - they bounce, explode, burn, zap, and corrode. Upgrade your firepower with elemental mods that light enemies ablaze, electrocute clusters, or melt through armored freaks.\u00a0Because regular ammo just doesn\u2019t cut it anymore.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875160/extras/3749f01e74b1d35252fc4ab91e688472.poster.avif?t=1748183258\" wi