r corrode armored foes into sludge. Every upgrade changes how you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absurd mutations with game-changing effects</strong><br>Gain mutations during each run that radically alter your abilities. Leech health with every kill, spawn fire trails, or deploy grenade-launching turrets to fight by your side. Stack them to create madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple survivors and playstyles to master</strong><br>Whether you favor fast-moving sharpshooters, explosive brawlers, or balanced all-rounders, each survivor offers a unique playstyle with different strengths and weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical deployables that shape the battlefield</strong><br>Control the chaos with grenades, decoys, and turret placements. Set traps, hold choke points, or simply blow everything up in style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable roguelite runs with randomized upgrades</strong><br>Levels, enemy spawns, and upgrade choices are randomized every time you play - no two runs ever feel the same. Adapt on the fly and survive the unpredictable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless build variety and broken combos</strong><br>Want ricocheting flame bullets that leech life while your decoys explode into acid clouds? Go for it. The system is built to let you push the limits of what\u2019s possible - and what\u2019s absurd.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
